<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14984" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρημένος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		pf.
		part.
		
			Pass.
		, expld. by Gramm. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβλαμμένος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>distressed, worn out,</i> once
			in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήραϊ λυγρῷ κεῖται ἐνὶ μεγάροις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.435
				</span></i>
			; more freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνῳ καὶ καμάτῳ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίπτε τόσον, Πολύφημ᾽, ἀρημένος ὧδ᾽
					ἐβόησας;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.403
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήρᾳ ὑπὸ λιπαρῷ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.136
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύῃ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.53
				</span></i>
			. [Prob. akin to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρή,
			Ἄρης.</span>]</div>
